#### Example 2: Application-Level Business Rule Invariant

```java
// Application-side invariant assertion (Spring component)
@Component
public class EligibilityRuleInvariantPublisher {

    private final AuditEventPublisher auditPublisher;

    /**
     * INVARIANT BHINV-BUS-001: Every eligibility determination must cite
     * a rule set version. A determination without a rule citation is a
     * processing integrity violation.
     */
    public EligibilityDecision enforce(EligibilityRequest request, EligibilityDecision decision) {
        if (decision.getRuleCitationVersion() == null || decision.getRuleCitationVersion().isBlank()) {
            auditPublisher.publishInvariantViolation(InvariantViolationEvent.builder()
                .invariantId("BHINV-BUS-001")
                .severity(Severity.HIGH)
                .service("eligibility-api")
                .detail("Eligibility determination for member " + request.getMemberIdHash() +
                        " produced without rule citation version")
                .goldenPath("HIPAA-REST-MICROSERVICE-AKS-V1")
                .build());
        }
        return decision;
    }
}
```

